      "role": "user",
      "content": "i already did all that though. i changed my passwords and set up 2fa on the ones i still have access to, but it didn't stop the deletions. the thing is, it's not just \"unusual activity\" like a random bot or a hacker trying to get in... it's like the accounts are being unmade. they aren't being flagged for security, they're just being erased from the database. doesn't that seem a bit too surgical to just be a coincidence or a common hack?",
